{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-02", "pageid": 107409, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-01\" title=\"冰原时隙-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-03\" title=\"冰原时隙-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E8.B5.B7.E6.84.8F.E5.A4.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一起意外\">一起意外</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一起意外</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Encounter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深夜的军用帐篷中，中尉握紧了自己的武器，与闯入者们对峙着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并没有因为自己的对手是一只松鼠和三只企鹅就放松警惕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>听我说，小妞，冷静点儿。别用你手里那玩意儿对着松鼠，这可不太礼貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>也不符合动物保护法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔将枪口略微下移，但没有完全放开对武器的掌握。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我能感受到你为放松气氛做出的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>但影响我是否攻击的决定性因素并不包括物种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你有一分钟时间可以表明身份和来意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿！这难道还不够明显吗？我们当然没有敌意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉不为所动，视线盯着自己的手表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎嘎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我知道，杰克老弟，我知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>身份，来意，当然——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠举起爪子，挨个指着身后的三只企鹅介绍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>绒毛公爵，红色泰坦，杰克老弟。虽然刚从迈阿密回来，但是货真价实的南极土著企鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，它用爪尖指向了自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嚼嚼松果，全名嚼嚼松果·费尔柴尔德，来自佛罗里达州的神秘学家，一名动物保护活动家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉有些困惑地侧了侧头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>动物保护活动家……保护这些企鹅？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>显而易见！所以我们可不是什么可疑的人，赶紧把你的枪放下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>免费告诉你一个情报，这里可不太安全——有一群坏家伙正在冰天雪地里游荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>他们戴着面具，满脸流油。我们正在逃避他们的追捕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>总之，我很抱歉闯入了你的私人领地，但一分钟快到了，你能不能先把那玩意儿放下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>最后一个问题，你们是怎么做到无声潜入我的驻地的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>天哪，睁大你的眼睛好好看看，我们可是企鹅和松鼠！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>人类总是觉得自己了解一切，但是你们根本发现不了这片大冰壳子底下藏着多少通道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>冰层缝隙、积雪空层、火山烟道！每个都畅通无阻，比高速公路还快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>好吧，抱歉伙计，我的情绪是有点儿激动，毕竟我可不习惯被人用枪指着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>而且我的脑袋又开始疼了，真不知道是怎么回事儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉仔细观察着松鼠和企鹅钻出来的地面，冰雪之下隐约可见幽邃狭小的孔洞证明了它的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她如约收起了武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你说的那些“面具怪人”，活动范围离这里很近吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这可不好说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我们走的都是“捷径”，跟地面上的距离可不太一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-524801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-524801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-524801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎，嘎嘎嘎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>没错。附近有好几个大冰山，从上头翻过去可不容易。但如果你能走火山烟道的话，一下子就能过来，不用半个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉看向一旁打开的军事地图，结合一些简单的计算，快速确定了它所描述的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果是这里的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿，小妞，我得说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>中尉。莫莉德尔中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>天啊，当然！她有个军衔，显而易见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>好吧，向您敬礼，中尉！我不想打断你的作战计划，但你介意帮个忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠说着，忽然用爪子抱住了脑袋，用力地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我是说，或许你有止痛药吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们的战略储备里不包括兽用药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你的体型太小了，直接使用人类常用药的剂量会很危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>噢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>抱歉，中尉。我是说，我还以为你在开无聊的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠很不自在地耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>跟我来吧。我的士兵们已经休息了，请不要随意发出声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在弄明白发生什么之前，它下意识地带着自己的企鹅朋友们跟上了中尉的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>给你做一些基础的检查和处理，我接受过一些应急医疗培训。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>太棒了，中尉。你是我来南极之后遇到的唯一一个好人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>谢谢。你还遇到过其他人类吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>当然，戴着面具流黑油的那些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……你们不应该现在来这里的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我也不想来，这里冷得吓人！可是瞧瞧它们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠抬起爪子，指了指跟在自己身后的阿德利企鹅们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>把南极的企鹅关在迈阿密的动物园里！天知道是谁想出来的烂主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>基金会的人只会告诉你他们已经知道了，然后什么都不做……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>他们根本不关心动物的处境！可我难道能就这样看着它们受苦吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的脚步忽然停顿了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>迈阿密，基金会，动物园，松鼠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我应该在哪里听说过你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这倒不奇怪。全佛罗里达的动物园门口都张贴着我的画像——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>还要在我的脸上用红笔打个重重的叉。真没礼貌，对吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉为这绘声绘色的描述露出了一个笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但紧接着她就看到松鼠停下了脚步。那双黑色的圆眼珠正打量着自己，毛绒绒的脸上逐渐露出相当拟人的惊恐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我的老天！中尉，你的脸——你为什么也在流黑油？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔屏住了呼吸。她按住备用配枪，里面有一颗子弹，在踏上南极的时候就已经预防性地上膛。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-02"}}